        "id": "section-9",
        "title": "9. Answer Key",
        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>His remote job made it possible because he can work from almost anywhere.</li>\n<li>A bookstore.</li>\n<li>No. She works at the hospital, but she no longer works on the wards; she works in staff training now.</li>\n<li>His photography and whether he still takes pictures.</li>\n<li>No. Daniel needs to check his schedule first.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>F</li>\n<li>T</li>\n<li>F</li>\n<li>T</li>\n<li>F</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 选择合适的表达</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>It&#39;s been ages</li>\n<li>still working</li>\n<li>get back to you</li>\n<li>catch up</li>\n<li>What about</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. used to、still或not … anymore</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>used to live</li>\n<li>still</li>\n<li>anymore</li>\n<li>used to be</li>\n<li>anymore</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>D. 参考表达</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Long time no see! How have you been?</li>\n<li>I thought you were still living in Beijing.</li>\n<li>I have to get going, but we should really catch up.</li>\n<li>Let me check my schedule and get back to you.</li>\n<li>It was really nice seeing you.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>开放题可以有其他自然说法，不需要和参考答案完全一致。</p>\n<hr>\n"
