        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Thursday at 4:30 p.m.</li>\n<li>Her work orientation has been extended.</li>\n<li>Five is earlier than the earliest time she can arrive, 5:30.</li>\n<li>Friday at 11:20 or 2:40.</li>\n<li>Friday the 11th at 11:20 with Rosa.</li>\n<li>Date, time, stylist and reference number; she also confirms the arrival instruction.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Read, Notice, Understand</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>The day/date and the time changed.</li>\n<li>Client, service, stylist and reference number remain the same. Any three.</li>\n<li>11:15 a.m.</li>\n<li>Example: <strong>C — I confirm Friday the 11th at 11:20 a.m. with Rosa. Thank you.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Grammar Refresh</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>two seats</li>\n<li>the text says four</li>\n<li>too early</li>\n<li>better than</li>\n<li><strong>Just to check, the new time is Friday at two forty, right?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>F  2. T  3. F  4. T  5. F  6. T</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 顺序</h3>\n<p>4, 1, 6, 3, 5, 2（按题目列出顺序）</p>\n<h3>C. 参考</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Sorry, I asked for Wednesday the ninth at two fifteen, not Tuesday the eighteenth at two fifty. There seem to be two mistakes. Could you fix those, please? Just to check, the new appointment is Wednesday the ninth at two fifteen with Jordan, right?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>D. 参考消息</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hi Daniel, the bicycle fitting has changed because the workshop will be closed Monday afternoon. It is now Tuesday at 3:40, not Monday at 3:00. Please meet me at the rear service entrance instead of the front desk, and remember to bring reference card RF-218.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>F. Unit 3结转检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Could you do me a favor?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I could really use your help.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I really appreciate it.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Thanks for helping me out.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I owe you one.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Happy to help.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>G. Unit 4无提示检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>A table for three, please.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>We have a reservation under Morgan Lee.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I&#39;d like the baked fish.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Could we have a basket of bread?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Does that come with a salad?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Could we get the check, please?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>This isn&#39;t what I ordered.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I ordered two black pens, but I got two blue pens.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I was expecting a window seat.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>There seems to be a mistake.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Could you fix that, please?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>How long will that take?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I&#39;d like to exchange this.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Do you have this in a medium?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Could I try them on?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>How does it fit?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It&#39;s too small.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>This one fits better.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I&#39;ll take this one.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>参考答案只用于完成后核对。功能相同、语气合适的替代表达可以完成交际，但只有实际无提示出现对应词块，才登记该词块的R。</p>\n<hr>\n"
