        "html": "<h3>A. Read three public signs</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>TRAIN:</strong> Priority seats must be offered to passengers who need them.<br><strong>CLINIC:</strong> Please keep phone calls outside the waiting area.<br><strong>LIBRARY:</strong> Shared tables are available. Do not leave bags on empty chairs.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>选择最合适的行为并说明理由：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>A bag is on a library chair, but its owner is sitting beside it.</li>\n<li>You need to take a call in the clinic waiting area.</li>\n<li>You are using a priority seat and a passenger who needs it boards.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. Permission is not the same as ownership</h3>\n<p><strong>Is this seat taken?</strong> 询问事实；<strong>Do you mind if I sit here?</strong> 请求许可。公共座位没有被占用时，通常不需要长篇解释。</p>\n<h3>C. Safe small talk</h3>\n<p>适合本课的内容：拥挤程度、天气对交通的影响、站点、可见活动。个人住址、收入、婚姻情况和联系方式不属于陌生人微对话的默认内容。</p>\n<hr>\n"
