        "html": "<h3>1. Can I …?</h3>\n<p>日常、中性，适合低风险请求：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Can I leave my bag here for a minute?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>2. Could I …?</h3>\n<p>比 <strong>Can I</strong> 稍柔和：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Could I open the window?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这里的 <strong>could</strong> 不是过去时，而是礼貌距离。</p>\n<h3>3. Do you mind if I + 现在时 …?</h3>\n<p>直接询问对方是否介意：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Do you mind if I sit here?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>回答要特别清楚：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>No, not at all. Go ahead.</strong> 允许<br><strong>I&#39;m sorry, someone&#39;s sitting there.</strong> 不允许并说明事实</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>快速练习</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>__________ this seat taken?</li>\n<li>Do you mind if I __________ here? <em>(sit)</em></li>\n<li>Could I __________ my suitcase beside yours? <em>(put)</em></li>\n<li>Give clear permission: “No, not at all. __________.”</li>\n<li>Decline because a friend is returning: “I&#39;m sorry, __________.”</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n"
