        "title": "3. Read, Notice, Understand",
        "html": "<h3>A. Booking confirmation</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>HARBOR HOTEL — HH-7315</strong><br>Guest: Lena Ortiz<br>Room: standard, courtyard side, work desk<br>Check-in: from 3:00 p.m.<br>Check-out: by 11:00 a.m.<br>One-night stay; payment received</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>B. Options card</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Option</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Available</th>\n<th>Desk</th>\n<th>Location</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Extra cost</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Keep original room</td>\n<td align=\"right\">by 4:00</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>courtyard side</td>\n<td align=\"right\">$0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Change rooms</td>\n<td align=\"right\">now</td>\n<td>no</td>\n<td>quieter upper floor</td>\n<td align=\"right\">$0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>回答：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Which option is available sooner?</li>\n<li>Which option meets the work-desk requirement?</li>\n<li>Is either option more expensive?</li>\n<li>What information supports Lena&#39;s statement that she was told the room would be ready by three?</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. 不把选择变成输赢</h3>\n<p>“现在可用”与“有书桌”是不同优点。合理选择取决于学习者的需求。教材答案说明Lena为何这样选，不宣称所有顾客都必须作同样选择。</p>\n<hr>\n"
