        "html": "<h3>1. if说明方案条件</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>If we wait</strong>, when will it be ready?<br><strong>If we change rooms</strong>, can we move now?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这里只讨论真实可行的当前选择，不扩展假设语气。</p>\n<h3>2. can说明可行性，could提出请求</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We <strong>can</strong> store your bags.<br><strong>Could</strong> you offer us another room?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>3. 比较后明确偏好</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The other room is <strong>quieter</strong>, but it has <strong>no desk</strong>.<br>We&#39;d prefer <strong>to keep</strong> the original room.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>4. yet与by</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The room isn&#39;t ready <strong>yet</strong>. <em>(到现在尚未完成)</em><br>It will be ready <strong>by four</strong>. <em>(不晚于四点)</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>快速练习</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>If we __________, when will the room be ready? <em>(wait)</em></li>\n<li>Could you __________ us another room? <em>(offer)</em></li>\n<li>We&#39;d prefer __________ keep the original room.</li>\n<li>The room isn&#39;t ready __________.</li>\n<li>It should be ready __________ four.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n"
