        "html": "<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Lena arrives before the stated check-in time.</li>\n<li>The original room has a desk.</li>\n<li>The room available now also has a desk.</li>\n<li>Luggage storage is beside the front desk.</li>\n<li>The work lounge is on the second floor.</li>\n<li>Lena waits until after five for the room.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 比较并选择</h3>\n<p>根据第3部分分别为两种需求选择方案，并说明理由：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>You need a desk for a two-hour online meeting.</li>\n<li>You need a quiet room immediately and do not need a desk.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. 酒店内路线</h3>\n<p>把前台指令复述为三步：电梯、二楼、courtyard标志和lounge位置。故意漏掉一项，让伙伴追问后补全。</p>\n<h3>D. 未知服务补救</h3>\n<p>伙伴暗中选择：原房间四点可用、无书桌房现在可用、带书桌升级房现在可用但需加$25。你必须询问时间、设施和费用后再选择。</p>\n<h3>E. Lesson 16结转检索</h3>\n<p>遮住第16课，只读英文情境。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Call a dental office and identify that your call concerns an existing booking.</li>\n<li>Ask to change the booking, not cancel it.</li>\n<li>Ask whether any time is open on Friday afternoon.</li>\n<li>Explain that 3:30 is impossible and 4:15 is your first possible time.</li>\n<li>After agreeing on Friday at 4:30, ask for written confirmation of the changed time.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>F. Unit 5无提示检索</h3>\n<p>合上第17—19课。下面18题分别检索三课的18项全新主动词块。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>In a waiting room, ask whether an apparently empty chair is already being used.</li>\n<li>After learning the chair is free, politely ask the person beside it whether sitting there is acceptable.</li>\n<li>Give clear permission for someone to use the shared outlet.</li>\n<li>At a station, comment that the crowd is larger than it normally is.</li>\n<li>A stranger has paused reading to answer you. End the exchange and say you will stop interrupting the book.</li>\n<li>End a brief conversation with someone beginning a journey.</li>\n<li>At a metro entrance, ask which route you and your friend should use.</li>\n<li>Tell someone to use the Red Line in the direction of North Point.</li>\n<li>Explain that the rider must transfer at King Street to the Yellow Line.</li>\n<li>Tell the rider the station where the journey ends.</li>\n<li>Ask for the number of stations in that part of the route.</li>\n<li>Direct the rider to use signs marked “Exit B.”</li>\n<li>A departure board now shows a later time. State that the train has suffered a delay with a present-result form.</li>\n<li>Ask whether the duration of the delay is known.</li>\n<li>State that the departure now uses Platform 8.</li>\n<li>Ask your companion to list the possible responses to the disruption.</li>\n<li>Offer the 6:10 bus as an alternative, without claiming you have chosen it.</li>\n<li>Promise to inform Jordan about the changed arrival, using the short notification expression.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>G. Unit 5现实任务</h3>\n<p>伙伴给你一套未知材料：公共座位规则、两线地图、延误公告和酒店选项卡。你需要完成“许可—路线—变化—通知—解决”五步，最终确认一个可执行方案。</p>\n<hr>\n"
