        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>For a week. 2. Last Monday. 3. It has been worse. 4. When he lies down at night. 5. Fever, shortness of breath and chest pain. 6. No.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Read, Notice, Understand</h3>\n<p>Example: <strong>He&#39;s had the cough for seven days. It&#39;s been worse since Friday.</strong> No reported fever, shortness of breath or chest pain.</p>\n<h3>Grammar Refresh</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>for  2. since  3. started  4. haven&#39;t  5. since</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>F  2. T  3. T  4. F  5. F  6. T</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. for还是since</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>for  2. since  3. since  4. for  5. since</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. 参考</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I&#39;ve had a sore throat for three days. It started on Saturday. It&#39;s been worse since last night, and it gets worse when I speak. I haven&#39;t had any fever.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>E. Lesson 20间隔检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>We were told it would be ready by noon.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Is there somewhere we can leave our bags?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Could you offer us another room?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>开放答案必须区分观察、个人报告和诊断。教材只评价信息是否清楚，不判断健康状况。</p>\n<hr>\n"
