        "title": "7. Practice",
        "html": "<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>The Wi-Fi drops once a day.</li>\n<li>Both the laptop and phone are affected.</li>\n<li>Aisha says the router is definitely broken.</li>\n<li>She has already restarted the router.</li>\n<li>Support asks her to open the equipment.</li>\n<li>A technician visit is arranged.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 从日志生成报告</h3>\n<p>用第3部分日志说5句：现象、频率、设备、影响、是否知道原因。</p>\n<h3>C. 顺序和结果</h3>\n<p>把步骤排序并用完整英语转告：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>waited for steady lights</li>\n<li>turned the router off</li>\n<li>tested the laptop</li>\n<li>turned the router on</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后补充问题仍在发生。</p>\n<h3>D. 未知追问</h3>\n<p>伙伴扮演支持人员，从“开始时间、频率、设备、影响、已试步骤、步骤结果”随机追问三项。你只能根据日志回答；不知道就说不知道。</p>\n<h3>E. Lesson 21间隔检索</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>A headache began four days ago and continues now. State the symptom and duration.</li>\n<li>Give the exact past start point: Thursday morning.</li>\n<li>Explain that the problem has become more severe from Saturday until now.</li>\n<li>Say that the discomfort increases whenever you climb stairs.</li>\n<li>Report that you have experienced no fever.</li>\n<li>Close the description by saying you have reported all the changes you observed.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>F. 实用写作</h3>\n<p>给技术支持写60—80词消息：故障、频率、设备、影响、两个已试步骤、当前结果。对方随机问一个未提供的细节，再写25—40词回复并请求下一步。</p>\n<hr>\n"
