        "html": "<h3>1. 一般过去时：事情怎样发生</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I <strong>left</strong> my keys inside.<br>The door <strong>closed</strong> behind me.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>2. 现在时：我在哪里、现在需要什么</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I&#39;<strong>m</strong> outside the main entrance.<br>My battery <strong>is</strong> at fifteen percent.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>3. 现在完成时：到现在已经试过什么</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I&#39;ve already <strong>tried calling</strong> my neighbor.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>4. 反身代词是小型词汇点</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I locked <strong>myself</strong> out.<br>She locked <strong>herself</strong> out.<br>They locked <strong>themselves</strong> out.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>本课不系统扩展所有反身代词用法。</p>\n<h3>快速练习</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>I __________ my keys inside. <em>(leave, past)</em></li>\n<li>The door __________ behind me. <em>(close, past)</em></li>\n<li>I&#39;m __________ the main entrance.</li>\n<li>I&#39;ve already tried __________ the manager. <em>(call)</em></li>\n<li>She locked __________ out.</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n"
