        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>He took recycling downstairs and the door closed while his keys and fob were inside. 2. On the kitchen counter. 3. Under the covered Pine Street main entrance. 4. Aisha. 5. Forcing the door and climbing. 6. An authorized worker verifies his ID and lets him in.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Grammar Refresh</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>left  2. closed  3. outside  4. calling  5. herself</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>F  2. T  3. F  4. F  5. T  6. T</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 四类信息</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>event  2. location  3. tried  4. request</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>E. Lesson 20结转检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>We were told it would be ready by two.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Is there somewhere we can leave our bags?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Could you offer us another room?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>If we wait, when will it be ready?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>We&#39;d prefer to take the quieter option.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>F. Lesson 22间隔检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>You might want to get that checked.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It might be a good idea to bring a written timeline.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>You should contact a qualified professional.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>You&#39;d better call now, or the desk will close.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>If it keeps happening, contact the service team.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I can&#39;t tell what it is, but you should ask a qualified person.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>G. Unit 6无提示检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>I&#39;ve had this sore throat for five days.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It started on Sunday evening.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It&#39;s been worse since Tuesday.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It gets worse when I speak for a long time.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I haven&#39;t had any fever.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>That&#39;s everything I&#39;ve noticed.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>You might want to get that checked.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It might be a good idea to write down the times.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>You should contact the appropriate qualified service.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>You&#39;d better call now.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>If it keeps happening, …</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I can&#39;t tell what it is, but …</strong></li>\n<li><strong>The Wi-Fi keeps dropping.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>It happens every thirty minutes.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I&#39;ve already tried restarting it.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>First, I restarted the device. Then, I tested the connection.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>The problem is still happening.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>What should I try next?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>开放题允许其他自然表达，但指定词块R只在无提示实际出现时登记。任何涉及安全、医疗或进入权限的任务都必须遵守当地专业流程。</p>\n<hr>\n"
