        "html": "<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Daniel receives no message at all.</li>\n<li>Marcus first attaches the meeting notes.</li>\n<li>The correct guide has twelve pages.</li>\n<li>Daniel has not opened the correct file.</li>\n<li>Daniel will send one file format.</li>\n<li>Marcus confirms receipt before four.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. just、already还是yet</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>The file arrived one minute ago: “I&#39;ve __________ received it.”</li>\n<li>Aisha replied earlier than expected: “She&#39;s __________ replied.”</li>\n<li>The approval is still missing: “We haven&#39;t received it __________.”</li>\n<li>Ask about the current state: “Have they replied __________?”</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. 精确跟进</h3>\n<p>把模糊问题 <strong>Did you get it?</strong> 改成三个问题，分别确认：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>今天9点发送的消息；</li>\n<li>附件中的12页PDF；</li>\n<li>对方是否已经看过评论。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>D. 未知状态互动</h3>\n<p>伙伴秘密抽取一张状态卡：<strong>message missing / attachment missing / wrong version / received but not reviewed</strong>。你必须先确认具体状态，再选择检查、重发或约定跟进时间。</p>\n<h3>E. Lesson 24间隔检索（一）</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>You cannot access your project account after changing the password. State that you locked yourself out of the account.</li>\n<li>You are waiting at the side entrance of an office. Give your exact current location.</li>\n<li>Explain that your access badge is inside the meeting room.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>F. 实用写作</h3>\n<p>写55—75词跟进邮件：说明原邮件主题和发送时间，询问消息与附件是否到达，列出文件名，并约定若何时仍未收到就重新发送。</p>\n<hr>\n"
