        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>The permission log. 2. The visuals and source files. 3. Writing the captions. 4. It does not name the permission log or final check. 5. Aisha. 6. Daniel.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Grammar Refresh</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>prepare  2. were  3. were  4. was  5. am</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>F  2. F  3. T  4. F  5. T  6. T</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 任务、遗漏、补救</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>original expectation  2. gap  3. repair  4. original expectation  5. repair</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. 参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>The room booking is still missing. I thought you were handling it. Can we check the note?</strong></li>\n<li><strong>We may have misunderstood each other. Let&#39;s identify the missing step.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I&#39;ll test the link by noon, and you can do the final check by one.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>E. Lesson 24间隔检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>The secure office door closed behind me.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Could someone let me in?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>开放题必须以记录和可见任务为依据。<strong>be supposed to</strong> 只能说明预期，不能单独证明过错。</p>\n<hr>\n"
