        "html": "<h3>A. Rough meeting notes</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Daniel — text changes — Thu 11:00<br>Aisha — accessibility check — Thu 1:00 — after Daniel&#39;s files<br>Marcus — send both files to five reviewers — Thu 2:00 — after Aisha confirms<br>Marcus — follow up if needed — Fri 11:30<br>Daniel + Aisha — final changes — Fri afternoon — if feedback arrives<br>Marcus — full release — Mon 9:00</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>把每行整理为 <strong>action / owner / deadline / dependency</strong>。哪些行动项需要前一项先完成？</p>\n<h3>B. Decision or discussion?</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Statement</th>\n<th>Status</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Send to everyone Friday morning</td>\n<td>discussed, not chosen</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Use a five-person review first</td>\n<td>decided</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feedback due Friday noon</td>\n<td>decided</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wait another full week</td>\n<td>not chosen</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>会议总结只能写 <strong>decided</strong> 项目。讨论过并不等于通过。</p>\n<h3>C. A usable action item</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“Aisha will confirm both file formats by 1:00 Thursday, after Daniel sends the updated text.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这条行动项包含人、动作、对象、时间和前置条件。只写 <strong>Check files soon</strong> 不可执行。</p>\n<hr>\n"
