        "html": "<h3>Check the story</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>After dinner, when neither is rushing. 2. The plan was confirmed before they discussed it. 3. Maya&#39;s Saturday morning training. 4. A check with each other. 5. Add work commitments promptly. 6. Update the calendar, send a message, then confirm.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Grammar Refresh</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>frustrated  2. to  3. was  4. to  5. is</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>A. 理解检查</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>F  2. T  3. F  4. T  5. F  6. T</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>B. 事件还是标签</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>event  2. feeling  3. need  4. label</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>C. 参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>I feel uncomfortable when jokes are made about my work in front of other people. I need us to discuss feedback privately.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I feel ignored when I answer a question and the topic changes immediately. What would help is one response before we move on.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>I feel worried when the meeting time changes without a message. I need an update before the change is confirmed.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>E. Lesson 28间隔检索参考</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Let&#39;s go over it once more.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Here&#39;s what we&#39;ve decided.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Who&#39;s responsible for contacting the venue?</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>开放题必须基于可观察事件；不同感受和解决办法都可合理，但不能把标签伪装成感受。</p>\n<hr>\n"
