        "title": "3. Read, Notice, Understand",
        "html": "<h3>A. Message trail</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Daniel to Lena:</strong> I should be free Saturday, but send me the time first.<br><strong>Lena to Owen:</strong> Daniel will help Saturday morning.<br><strong>Owen to Daniel:</strong> Thanks for confirming Saturday!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>哪一条把“可能有空”错误变成了“已经确认”？写出更准确的Lena消息。</p>\n<h3>B. Repair record</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Repair step</th>\n<th>Evidence</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Name the impact</td>\n<td>Daniel received a final commitment he had not made.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accept responsibility</td>\n<td>Lena says she should have checked.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Correct the record</td>\n<td>Lena calls Owen.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Restore choice</td>\n<td>Daniel receives the exact Sunday time before deciding.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Close the gap</td>\n<td>Another Saturday volunteer is confirmed.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3>C. Intention does not erase impact</h3>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I didn&#39;t mean to put you in an awkward position, <strong>but I did</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>这里的 <strong>but I did</strong> 承认影响。不要说 <strong>I&#39;m sorry, but I was only trying to help</strong>，因为它容易把道歉重新变成自我辩护。</p>\n<hr>\n"
